{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Hecke.TwFullRank","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwFullRank","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Hecke.TwBasisField","lean:module:QOU.Hecke.FullRank"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.isHeckeOfFullRank_iwahoriHecke","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.isHeckeOfFullRank_iwahoriHecke","kind":"instance","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwFullRank.lean#L53-L60","doc":"**The Iwahori rank axiom holds for `IwahoriHecke K q n`, at every rank\n(sorry-free).**  Freeness is automatic over a field; the dimension is\n`QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.finrank_eq_factorial`, which comes from the `T_w` basis\nand is the first statement of the Iwahori basis theorem in this corpus. ","signatureChunk":0}]}